      >
      <div class="collapsible-content__inner rte">
        
                      <p><strong>Limited Flight: </strong>8 feet sensor to tee with 8-13 feet ball flight. Aluminum stickers required.</p><p><strong>Outdoor Full Swing: </strong>8 feet sensor to tee with unrestricted ball flight.</p><p><strong>Limited Flight Chipping:</strong> 8 feet sensor to tee with 8 feet ball flight. Aluminum stickers required.</p><p><strong>Chipping: </strong>8 feet sensor to tee with maximum 50 yards ball flight.</p><p><strong>Putting:</strong> 7 feet sensor to tee with maximum 30 feet ball flight. 12 degree tilt required.</p><h4><strong>Electronic Noise:</strong></h4><p>Mevo+ is designed to operate in most environments. However certain appliances and equipment can create noise that can interfere with resulting shots. Some common noisy objects are: </p><ul><li>aircon</li><li>fluorescent lights</li><li>fans</li><li>fridges</li><li>tv’s, laptops & desktop computers <em>in front</em> <em>of</em> the Mevo+ </li><li>signal towers</li></ul>
                      
                    
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
                    

                    
                    
