                      <p><strong>Delivery Times</strong></p><p>Allow 1 business day for processing, then ships free 2-Day Air within the Continental U.S.</p><p>Please note that the total time to deliver an order includes time to process your order and the time to ship it to your chosen address.</p><p><strong>Shipping Rates and Estimates</strong></p><p>Charges to deliver to your shipping address will be calculated and displayed at checkout when you order. We offer free shipping within the Continental United States.</p><p>Please visit our <a href="/policies/shipping-policy" target="_blank" title="Shipping Policy">shipping policy page</a> for more information.</p>
                      
                    
