  <div class="page-width feature-row-wrapper feature-row--50"><div class="feature-row"><div class="feature-row__item feature-row__images " data-aos><div class="feature-row__first-image"><div class="image-wrap " style="height: 0; padding-bottom: 70.58823529411765%;">



<image-element data-aos="image-fade-in" data-aos-offset="150">


  
<img src="//flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=1080" alt="" srcset="//flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=180 180w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=360 360w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=540 540w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=750 750w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=900 900w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/FlightScope-2023-V8_iPhone_apps.png?v=1749483918&amp;width=1080 1080w" width="1080" height="762.3529411764706" loading="lazy" class="feature-row__image image-element" sizes="(min-width: 769px) 50vw, 100vw">
  


</image-element>
</div></div></div>
<div class="feature-row__item feature-row__text feature-row__text--left text-center" data-aos><h2 class="h1 appear-delay">Practice App for iOS and Android</h2><div class="rte appear-delay-1"><p>A comprehensive and customizable phone, tablet, and watch app allowing users to teach, fit, and practice with radar data, video capabilities, 3D trajectories, and more.<br/><br/>Data Margins and Instant Feedback<br/><br/>Set your minimum and maximum values for any data parameter to train smarter and improve consistency.<br/><br/>Customizable Trajectory View<br/><br/>Customize your trajectory screen display and preferred performance data blocks for the ultimate user experience.<br/><br/>Data and Video Combined<br/><br/>Automatically record, clip, and store video of every swing, without interruption, for easy review.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>

</div>
</div><div id="shopify-section-template--15683723133060__text_and_image_xzhRmf" class="shopify-section"><style data-shopify>
  
  
</style>

<div class="index-section">

  <div class="page-width feature-row-wrapper feature-row--50"><div class="feature-row"><div class="feature-row__item feature-row__text feature-row__text--right text-center" data-aos><h2 class="h1 appear-delay">Practice App for PC</h2><div class="rte appear-delay-1"><p>A comprehensive and customizable PC app allowing users to teach, fit, and practice with radar data, video capabilities, 3D trajectories, and more, all included with your Mevo+ purchase.<br/><br/>Complete Customization<br/><br/>Choose up to four views at a time for the ultimate practice, teaching, or fitting experience. Users have the ability to customize these four views to fit their exact needs.<br/><br/>Table with Averages<br/><br/>View your data for every shot in a comprehensive table that includes averages and standard deviations. Use your averages and standard deviations to identify areas to improve and monitor progress over time.<br/><br/>Split Screen<br/><br/>Users have the ability to choose any two views and see them side-by-side to make the experience simpler and more concise. Choose to view the radar data with your trajectory, face impact with radar data, and many more options.</p></div></div><div class="feature-row__item feature-row__images " data-aos><div class="feature-row__first-image"><div class="image-wrap " style="height: 0; padding-bottom: 61.05882352941176%;">



<image-element data-aos="image-fade-in" data-aos-offset="150">


  
<img src="//flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=1080" alt="PC Software" srcset="//flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=180 180w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=360 360w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=540 540w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=750 750w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=900 900w, //flightscope.com/cdn/shop/files/4panelaptopsmaller.png?v=1750339883&amp;width=1080 1080w" width="1080" height="659.435294117647" loading="lazy" class="feature-row__image image-element" sizes="(min-width: 769px) 50vw, 100vw">
  


