</div><div id="shopify-section-template--15683723133060__faq_Dg3QPH" class="shopify-section index-section"><div class="page-width page-width--narrow"><header class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-header__title">
        Your Questions Answered
      </h2>
    </header><script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "What data parameters does the Mevo+ provide?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Swing\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ball speed, club speed, smash factor, carry distance, launch angle, spin rate, apex height, flight time, angle of attack, spin loft, launch direction, spin axis, roll distance, total distance, lateral landing, shot dispersion, shot type\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipping\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ball speed, club speed, smash factor, carry distance, launch angle, spin rate, height, flight time, angle of attack, spin loft, launch direction, spin axis, roll distance, total distance, lateral landing, shot dispersion\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePutting\u003c\/strong\u003e: Launch speed, total distance, ball direction\u003cbr\/\u003eThe Mevo+ Pro Package add-on give access to over 20 additional data parameters, including the complete D-Plane dataset.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Is there a yearly fee?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eFlightScope Mevo+ data parameters will always be available free of charge without a subscription fee. Furthermore, software releases and firmware upgrades will be made available at no additional cost. \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlightScope does offer a suite of upgrades to compliment your Mevo+ that may have a one-time fee or a montly fee associated with them. These include, but are not limited to the Pro Package upgrade, Face Impact Location, Badger AI, FlightScope Planning Tool, and golf simulation software. \u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "What is included with my Mevo+ purchase?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eAlong with your Mevo+ you will receive a power adapter, USB charging cable, 100 metallic stickers, a carrying case, a 12-Course iOS E6 Connect license, and a quick-start guide.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Does Mevo+ have a built-in camera?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes, Mevo+ has a built-in camera for sensor alignment and video capture.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "How is the video recorded?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eSwing video can be captured with your Apple or Android device, as well as the radar's built-in camera, using the FS Golf application. Additional angles can be captured using the FS Multicam application which can be downloaded on the Apple App Store or the Google Play Store. The video is synchronized with your device to automatically record and clip video of your swing with an optional data overlay. \u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "What mobile devices are compatible with Mevo+?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApple\u003c\/strong\u003e: iPhone\/ iPad with: iOS 17 or newer\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAndroid\u003c\/strong\u003e: Android 6.0 or newer (devices made in 2015 or later) Bluetooth LE 4.0 - supports UART\/Serial Port Emulation service with RX and TX characteristics.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Where should the Mevo+ be placed?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimited Flight\u003c\/strong\u003e: Mevo+ will sit 8 feet behind the tee location.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOutdoor Full Swing\u003c\/strong\u003e: Mevo+ will sit 8 feet behind the tee location.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipping\u003c\/strong\u003e: Mevo+ will sit 7 feet behind the tee location.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePutting\u003c\/strong\u003e: Mevo+ will sit 5 feet behind the tee location.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Can Mevo+ be used indoors and outdoors? How much space is needed?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes, Mevo+ can be used indoors and outdoors.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpace Requirements\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOutdoor Full Swing\u003c\/strong\u003e: 7-9 feet sensor to tee distance with unrestricted ball flight\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndoor Full Swing\u003c\/strong\u003e: 7-9 feet sensor to tee distance with 13 feet of ball flight recommended - metallic dots or Titleist RCT balls required for accurate spin measurements\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePutting\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5 feet sensor to tee and minimum 7 foot maximum, 30 feet maximum putting range\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimited Flight Chipping\u003c\/strong\u003e: 7 feet sensor to tee and 8 feet minimum ball flight - metallic dots or Titleist RCT balls required for accurate spin measurements\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Flight Chipping\u003c\/strong\u003e: 7 feet sensor to tee and 6 feet minimum, 50 yard maximum ball flight\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Does Mevo+ have its own power source?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes. The battery life is up to 3 hours on a full charge, and up to 1.5 hours in simulator play.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlightScope offers extended battery life with an additional battery pack available to purchase as an add-on.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "What simulation software is Mevo+ integrated with?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eMevo+ is integrated with TruGolf (E6 Connect) and comes with ownership of 12 golf courses, 17 ranges, and a mini game powered by E6. This bundle that comes with the purchase of Mevo+ is for iOS and Windows PC. Customers have the option to purchase additional E6 simulation packages if they want more courses.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMevo+ is also integrated with The Golf Club 2019 (PC), Awesome Golf (PC \u0026 iOS), E6 Connect (iOS \u0026 PC), and Creative Golf 3D (PC), and GSPro (PC).\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e*The Mevo+ 2024 Edition comes with an exclusive 12 course pack on E6 Connect featuring different courses, including Pebble Beach and St Andrews.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Does Mevo+ have a combine feature?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes, the Mevo+ is compatible with the FS Skills App available on iOS and Android.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Does Mevo+ work with iPad?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes, Mevo+ works with any iPad as long as it has iOS 17 or later.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Does Mevo+ work with Android?",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eYes, the FS Golf App and the FS Skills App are both available on the Android platform with Mevo+.\u003c\/p\u003e"
                  }
                },
            
          
            
                {
                  "@type": "Question",
                  "name": "Battery Storage",
                  "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "\u003cp\u003eIf you are planning on storing your FlightScope unit for an extended period of time, please note that rechargeable batteries can slowly deplete over time when left unused. To better preserve the battery in your launch monitor over any extended period of non use, it is very important to take the following steps:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eClean and dry the unit.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEnsure that the battery is fully charged before putting it away for extended periods of time.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStore the unit indoors, in its case, pouch, box, or backpack.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStore in moderate temperatures, ideally between 60°-70° F. \u003cstrong\u003eAvoid hot and cold conditions\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWhen stored for an extended period of time, the battery should be recharged every 2-3 months to ensure it does not become completely drained.\u003cbr\/\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWhen the time comes that you wish to use the radar again, please give it another full charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e"
                  }
                }
            
          
        ]
      }
    </script><div >
        
