              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_Apf8LP"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>What data parameters does the Mevo+ provide?</span>
