</span>
<span>Is there a yearly fee?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_CcDfNy" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>FlightScope Mevo+ data parameters will always be available free of charge without a subscription fee. Furthermore, software releases and firmware upgrades will be made available at no additional cost. </p><p>FlightScope does offer a suite of upgrades to compliment your Mevo+ that may have a one-time fee or a montly fee associated with them. These include, but are not limited to the Pro Package upgrade, Face Impact Location, Badger AI, FlightScope Planning Tool, and golf simulation software. </p>
                </div>
