              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_wKQCb7"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Does Mevo+ have a built-in camera?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_wKQCb7" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes, Mevo+ has a built-in camera for sensor alignment and video capture.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_wRNXy8"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>How is the video recorded?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_wRNXy8" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Swing video can be captured with your Apple or Android device, as well as the radar's built-in camera, using the FS Golf application. Additional angles can be captured using the FS Multicam application which can be downloaded on the Apple App Store or the Google Play Store. The video is synchronized with your device to automatically record and clip video of your swing with an optional data overlay. </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_bBXCDF"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>What mobile devices are compatible with Mevo+?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_bBXCDF" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p><strong>Apple</strong>: iPhone/ iPad with: iOS 17 or newer</p><p><strong>Android</strong>: Android 6.0 or newer (devices made in 2015 or later) Bluetooth LE 4.0 - supports UART/Serial Port Emulation service with RX and TX characteristics.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_MCN6GF"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Where should the Mevo+ be placed?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_MCN6GF" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p><strong>Limited Flight</strong>: Mevo+ will sit 8 feet behind the tee location.<br/><strong>Outdoor Full Swing</strong>: Mevo+ will sit 8 feet behind the tee location.<br/><strong>Chipping</strong>: Mevo+ will sit 7 feet behind the tee location.<br/><strong>Putting</strong>: Mevo+ will sit 5 feet behind the tee location.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_t6KtAD"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Can Mevo+ be used indoors and outdoors? How much space is needed?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_t6KtAD" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes, Mevo+ can be used indoors and outdoors.</p><p><strong>Space Requirements</strong>:</p><p><strong>Outdoor Full Swing</strong>: 7-9 feet sensor to tee distance with unrestricted ball flight</p><p><strong>Indoor Full Swing</strong>: 7-9 feet sensor to tee distance with 13 feet of ball flight recommended - metallic dots or Titleist RCT balls required for accurate spin measurements</p><p><strong>Putting</strong>: 5 feet sensor to tee and minimum 7 foot maximum, 30 feet maximum putting range</p><p><strong>Limited Flight Chipping</strong>: 7 feet sensor to tee and 8 feet minimum ball flight - metallic dots or Titleist RCT balls required for accurate spin measurements</p><p><strong>Full Flight Chipping</strong>: 7 feet sensor to tee and 6 feet minimum, 50 yard maximum ball flight</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_We33Ax"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Does Mevo+ have its own power source?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_We33Ax" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes. The battery life is up to 3 hours on a full charge, and up to 1.5 hours in simulator play.</p><p>FlightScope offers extended battery life with an additional battery pack available to purchase as an add-on.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_KMRTYf"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>What simulation software is Mevo+ integrated with?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_KMRTYf" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Mevo+ is integrated with TruGolf (E6 Connect) and comes with ownership of 12 golf courses, 17 ranges, and a mini game powered by E6. This bundle that comes with the purchase of Mevo+ is for iOS and Windows PC. Customers have the option to purchase additional E6 simulation packages if they want more courses.</p><p>Mevo+ is also integrated with The Golf Club 2019 (PC), Awesome Golf (PC & iOS), E6 Connect (iOS & PC), and Creative Golf 3D (PC), and GSPro (PC).</p><p>*The Mevo+ 2024 Edition comes with an exclusive 12 course pack on E6 Connect featuring different courses, including Pebble Beach and St Andrews.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_m7xEHD"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Does Mevo+ have a combine feature?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_m7xEHD" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes, the Mevo+ is compatible with the FS Skills App available on iOS and Android.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_RjyWEW"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Does Mevo+ work with iPad?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_RjyWEW" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes, Mevo+ works with any iPad as long as it has iOS 17 or later.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_VeQ779"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Does Mevo+ work with Android?</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_VeQ779" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>Yes, the FS Golf App and the FS Skills App are both available on the Android platform with Mevo+.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div><div >
        
            <div>
              <button type="button" class="collapsible-trigger collapsible-trigger--inline collapsible--auto-height text-left" aria-controls="FAQ-content-question_f3jeNc"><span class="collapsible-trigger__icon collapsible-trigger__icon--circle collapsible-trigger__icon--open" role="presentation">
  <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation" class="icon icon--wide icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 28 16"><path d="m1.57 1.59 12.76 12.77L27.1 1.59" stroke-width="2" stroke="#000" fill="none"/></svg>
</span>
<span>Battery Storage</span>
              </button>
              <div id="FAQ-content-question_f3jeNc" class="collapsible-content collapsible-content--all">
                <div class="collapsible-content__inner collapsible-content__inner--faq rte">
                  <p>If you are planning on storing your FlightScope unit for an extended period of time, please note that rechargeable batteries can slowly deplete over time when left unused. To better preserve the battery in your launch monitor over any extended period of non use, it is very important to take the following steps:</p><ul><li>Clean and dry the unit.<br/></li><li>Ensure that the battery is fully charged before putting it away for extended periods of time.<br/></li><li>Store the unit indoors, in its case, pouch, box, or backpack.<br/></li><li>Store in moderate temperatures, ideally between 60°-70° F. <strong>Avoid hot and cold conditions</strong>.<br/></li><li>When stored for an extended period of time, the battery should be recharged every 2-3 months to ensure it does not become completely drained.<br/></li><li>When the time comes that you wish to use the radar again, please give it another full charge.</li></ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        
      </div></div>
